#. Description of the plugin
#: soapbox-for-blygger.php
msgid "Publishes your posts as a blyg: stable ids, versions, pins and a feed that other clients can subscribe to and quote. An independent implementation of the Blygger protocol; not affiliated with the Blygger project."
msgstr ""

